		(at 30.835278 37.259801 24.99997331)
		(descr "Addressable RGB LED lying on its side, firing along the board: OPSCO SK6805-EC3210R (LCSC C5378735), 3.2 x 1.0 x 1.48 mm. Land pattern from the datasheet's 'suggested solder pad size for side mounting' (https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C5378735.pdf, page 5): four pads in a row, DOUT 0.55 x 0.70, GND 0.55 x 0.50, VDD 0.55 x 0.50, DIN 0.55 x 0.70, gaps 0.43 / 0.30 / 0.43, top edges level. The lens points toward +Y of this footprint. Pad 1 GND, 2 DOUT, 3 DIN, 4 VDD. The drawing does not dimension the pads against the body: the body position here is an estimate (see docs/parts.md).")
